# RXSkySystem consolidation — 2026-09-15

User scope: physically move the used VDB sources and authored cloud/baking
functionality under RXSkySystem; leave unused source-library assets in place.

| Previous root | New root | Assets |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `/Game/CubelessClouds` | `/Game/RXSkySystem/CloudAuthoring` | 20 |
| `/Game/RXSkyBaking` | `/Game/RXSkySystem/Baking` | 131 |
| Used assets in `/Game/Cloud_VDB` | `/Game/RXSkySystem/VDB` | 16 |

Nineteen editor Python modules and the tracked bake reports/source sidecars moved
with their owning content. Module import names remain unchanged; the original
startup hook registers the new Python directory. Script consumers and active MD
paths were updated. Named published bake reports take precedence over stale
local reports; a migrated published report also resolves a matching local latest
pointer. Capture scratch files remain in Saved.

The original RX preview and Cubeless runtime preview paths are unchanged.
Unused VDBs and uncompleted experimental assets remain at their old locations.
The subsequent redirector cleanup updated nine original VDB example maps,
confirmed zero remaining referencers, and removed all thirteen migration
redirectors. The example maps remain at their original paths. Backups and
cleanup evidence are in `Saved/RXRedirectors_20260915`.

## Validation and recovery

The initial live rename stalled in a renderer flush. It was not retried while
in flight. The user closed the editor; subsequent work used headless UE 5.6.1.
Sequential renames exposed lost parent references during cold verification.
All 167 originals were restored from pre-move SHA-256-verified backups, then
loaded and renamed together. The successful final cold verification checks the
native assets, source material contract, Python imports and map behavior.

- 167 destination assets load; no missing package dependencies or old moved-path references.
- 19 modules import from the new directory.
- Seven levels load; Study03 retains 28 cloud-labelled actors and authoring synchronization succeeds.
- The frozen Study03 source is accepted by the bake adapter; the completed rebake report resolves moved outputs.
- The final Cubeless RX dependency closure excludes VDB, authoring, baking and UnrealMCP.
- Five principal levels cook for Windows SM6 with UnrealMCP disabled: zero errors, two existing warnings.
- Full offline verification passed against the frozen scoped candidate: 7,641 inputs unchanged before/after; implementation and asset hashes match this checkout. Unrelated working-tree changes were excluded.
- No rebake, cloud-art change or rendered visual comparison was performed for this path migration.

Detailed local evidence and original backups:
`MCPGameProject/Saved/RXConsolidation_20260915/`.
